          children: "\"Krishna tumhe koi nayi shiksha nahin de raha. Woh to tumhare saamne ek aaina rakh raha hai. Aaina kya batata hai? Yah ki devta aur danav — dono tumhare andar maujood hain. Ab sawaal yeh hai ki tum kaunsa chehra palat ke dekhte ho.\""
